window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-049-9477c42097f37a55.json"]={sha256:"9477c42097f37a5582f5478f252dd31fe6b1b7e8d9d91ba290e4ac1a00b042b5",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-d3b2ca631bf4dcd6","url":"https://packaging.python.org/en/latest/specifications/direct-url-data-structure/","title":"Direct URL Data Structure / PEP 610","titleEn":"Direct URL Data Structure / PEP 610","publisher":"Python Packaging Authority","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-049","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-049","related":[{"id":"security-v27-050","referenceUrls":["https://maven.apache.org/guides/mini/guide-reproducible-builds.html"],"title":"Apache Maven：輸出時間、外掛相容與獨立重建差異","titleEn":"Apache Maven: output timestamps, plugin compatibility and independent rebuilds","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：60%與70%可重算，editable仍明列可變；沒有把PEP610中繼資料誤當檔案防竄改保證。 交付direct-url-audit.json、branch移動差異及安裝後變更反例；所有URL為不含帳密的假來源。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 60 and 70 percent, retain editable origins as mutable and avoid describing PEP 610 metadata as a tamper-proof filesystem guarantee. Deliver direct-url-audit.json, branch-movement differences and a post-install-change counterexample. All URLs are credential-free fictional origins.","difference":"建立12個模組產物對，記錄JDK、Maven、外掛版本、outputTimestamp與工作路徑；保留參考產物，不讓第二次建置覆蓋比較基準。","differenceEn":"Build 12 module-artifact pairs with JDK, Maven, plugin revisions, outputTimestamp and working paths. Preserve the reference artifacts separately so the second build cannot overwrite the baseline and manufacture an apparent comparison success.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課穩定來源覆蓋要求能連到已核准不可變來源；branch/tag只是請求名稱，commit_id是解析版本。來源中繼資料本身不是已安裝位元組的簽章。 10份中6份有完整且核准的不可變來源，2份僅分支名稱、2份editable目錄；本課將後四份列為未滿足固定來源政策。 穩定來源覆蓋6/10×100=60%；補齊一份分支安裝的實際核准commit後為7/10×100=70%。","本課以位元組完全一致的產物比例衡量重建覆蓋；固定時間只是其中一項條件，需檢查工具版本與環境外洩。不同Maven版本預設行為應依文件核對，不假設都需同一手動開關。 12對產物中8對位元組相同，2對只差封存時間，2對含工作路徑差異；四個差異案例互不重疊。 相同比例8/12×100≈66.667%；修復兩個時間差異產物後變10/12×100≈83.333%，工作路徑差異仍存在。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Stable-origin coverage requires an approved immutable source association. Branches and tags are requested names while commit_id identifies the resolved revision. Origin metadata is not itself a signature over the currently installed filesystem bytes. Six of ten descriptors have complete approved immutable origins, two retain only branch names and two point to editable directories. The latter four do not satisfy the fixed-origin policy selected for this release exercise. Stable-origin coverage is 6/10×100=60 percent. Recording and approving the actual commit for one branch-origin installation raises it to 7/10×100=70 percent, without making editable directories immutable.","Measure byte-identical artifacts as rebuild coverage. Fixed time is one condition among tool versions and environment leakage. Check documented defaults for the selected Maven release rather than assuming every version requires the same manual switch. Eight of 12 artifact pairs are byte-identical, two differ only in archive timestamps and two embed different working paths. Keep the four differing cases disjoint and retain the exact byte-range or structured archive differences. Equality is 8/12×100, approximately 66.667 percent. Repairing the two timestamp-only artifacts gives 10/12×100, approximately 83.333 percent, while the working-path differences remain unresolved.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-059","referenceUrls":["https://docs.opensearch.org/latest/data-prepper/pipelines/dlq/"],"title":"OpenSearch Data Prepper：死信佇列與安全重送驗收","titleEn":"OpenSearch Data Prepper: dead-letter queues and controlled replay","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：60%與70%可重算，editable仍明列可變；沒有把PEP610中繼資料誤當檔案防竄改保證。 交付direct-url-audit.json、branch移動差異及安裝後變更反例；所有URL為不含帳密的假來源。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 60 and 70 percent, retain editable origins as mutable and avoid describing PEP 610 metadata as a tamper-proof filesystem guarantee. Deliver direct-url-audit.json, branch-movement differences and a post-install-change counterexample. All URLs are credential-free fictional origins.","difference":"分類可修復格式錯誤、暫時後端失敗與無法解碼資料，為每個事件保留原始bytes摘要及失敗原因。","differenceEn":"Classify repairable schema failures, transient backend failures and undecodable data, preserving original byte digests and failure reasons.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課穩定來源覆蓋要求能連到已核准不可變來源；branch/tag只是請求名稱，commit_id是解析版本。來源中繼資料本身不是已安裝位元組的簽章。 10份中6份有完整且核准的不可變來源，2份僅分支名稱、2份editable目錄；本課將後四份列為未滿足固定來源政策。 穩定來源覆蓋6/10×100=60%；補齊一份分支安裝的實際核准commit後為7/10×100=70%。","回收率以進入死信的唯一事件為分母；成功重送次數不能取代唯一成功事件數。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 100筆死信中，60筆可修格式、25筆暫時錯誤、15筆無法解碼；第一次成功回收其中50、20、0筆。 唯一回收70筆，回收率70%；剩30筆須維持原因與負責人，不能靜默刪除。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Stable-origin coverage requires an approved immutable source association. Branches and tags are requested names while commit_id identifies the resolved revision. Origin metadata is not itself a signature over the currently installed filesystem bytes. Six of ten descriptors have complete approved immutable origins, two retain only branch names and two point to editable directories. The latter four do not satisfy the fixed-origin policy selected for this release exercise. Stable-origin coverage is 6/10×100=60 percent. Recording and approving the actual commit for one branch-origin installation raises it to 7/10×100=70 percent, without making editable directories immutable.","Recovery rate uses unique dead-letter events as denominator; successful retry attempts cannot replace unique recovered records. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Of one hundred dead-letter records, sixty have repairable schema errors, twenty-five transient faults and fifteen undecodable payloads; recovery succeeds for 50,20,0. Seventy unique events recover, giving 70%; thirty retain unresolved reasons and owners rather than disappearing silently.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-df13fb07dd26c959","url":"https://maven.apache.org/guides/mini/guide-reproducible-builds.html","title":"Configuring for Reproducible Builds","titleEn":"Configuring for Reproducible Builds","publisher":"Apache Maven","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-ea1644be74450d13","url":"https://docs.opensearch.org/latest/data-prepper/pipelines/dlq/","title":"OpenSearch Data Prepper dead-letter queues","titleEn":"OpenSearch Data Prepper dead-letter queues","publisher":"OpenSearch","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
